From b03c07b5cab685936a63d7988220399dae7127a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:41:13 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] www: language packs for v3.7.8, 25 dictionaries (102.8 line)

- RTWK_47 and RTWK_48 (the mDNS switch on the Tweaks page and its hint) in all 25 packs, in
  lockstep. The hint quotes each pack's own names for Access Intranet, Set AP Isolated and Guest
  Portal. Machine-assisted translations.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
